# =============================================================================
# Lead-capture form (no backend / no database required)
# =============================================================================
# The contact form POSTs form data as JSON to NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT.
# Pick ONE of the two free options below. If neither is set, the form still
# validates and shows a success state, but nothing is delivered (dev mode).
#
# --- Option A: Web3Forms (https://web3forms.com) — free, no account wall ------
# 1. Enter your email at web3forms.com to get an access key.
# 2. Uncomment both lines below and paste your key.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT="https://api.web3forms.com/submit"
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ACCESS_KEY="your-web3forms-access-key"
#
# --- Option B: Formspree (https://formspree.io) — free tier -------------------
# Set the endpoint to your form's URL and leave the access key unset.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT="https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx"

# =============================================================================
# Site metadata
# =============================================================================
# Absolute base URL used for canonical links and OpenGraph tags.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL="http://localhost:3000"
